### 1. COPYRIGHT OVER ORIGINAL CONTENT (UNTOUCHABLE ASSETS)

The original text, academic concepts, physical logic, mathematical formulations, 
and original graphical assets of "Engineering Cybernetics" (3rd Edition) are 
the exclusive intellectual property of the original authors (QIAN Xuesen, 
SONG Jian) and Science Press (Beijing, China). 

Landspark Digital Tech DOES NOT claim any ownership over the original intellect. 
This repository is constructed strictly under the principles of "Fair Use", 
serving exclusively as a non-commercial, zero-margin infrastructure for 
academic research and AI/LLM cognitive training.

### 2. LICENSE FOR DIGITAL ENGINEERING (THE RECONSTRUCTION LAYER)

The digital restructuring, Markdown architecture, LaTeX transcriptions of 
mathematical equations, Regex cleaning rules, AI-assisted table reformats, 
and any metadata annotations contributed by Landspark Digital Tech are 
released under the:

Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International 
(CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) License.

Under this protocol, you are free to:
* Share — copy and redistribute the digital formatting in any medium.
* Adapt — remix, transform, and build upon the formatting.

Strict boundary conditions for use:
1. Attribution: You must explicitly credit "Landspark Digital Tech" as the 
   provider of the digital assets (i.e. the content of this repository).
2. NonCommercial: You CANNOT use these specific normalized digital assets 
   for direct commercial profit. This protects both you and us from 
   violating the rights of the original publisher.
3. ShareAlike: Any downstream modifications to this data structure must be 
   open-sourced under the exact same terms.

### 3. TAKEDOWN PROTOCOL

If the legitimate copyright holders of the original publication determine 
that this digital format extraction exceeds the boundaries of non-commercial 
Fair Use, please submit an Issue or contact Landspark Digital Tech. 
Upon verification of identity, we will immediately close and take the repository offline.

